<title>JAPAN: Nichiboshin - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nichiboshin - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     3.86		vs	    7.86</p>
<p> Operating     loss 2.35		vs     loss 9.68</p>
<p> Current	 loss 2.37		vs     loss 9.67</p>
<p> Net	    loss 48.71		vs    loss 73.83</p>
<p> EPS	   loss 600.77 yen	  vs   loss 910.63 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     81 million	  vs	  81 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nichiboshin Ltd is a short-term fund supplier.</p>
